@startuml agentic-service-execution-boundary
title Agentic Service Execution Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Agentic Service\n<<semantic>>" as asvc
class "Execution Mechanism\n<<technology>>" as exec

asvc --> exec : realized through

note right of exec
  May include:
  - Human
  - Agent
  - System
  - Service
  - Workflow
  - Agentic Workflow
end note

note bottom of asvc
  Material agentic behavior
  required per CR-ES-014 §8
end note
@enduml
